---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Garden Journal | Verdant Grove Studio"
  description="Seasonal living, garden design, and slow-living guidance from Verdant Grove Studio."
>
  <section class="journal-hero">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Garden Journal</p>
      <h1>Field notes for seasonal living and beautiful, useful gardens</h1>
      <p>
        This journal is where practical guidance meets the emotional side of gardening: what to
        plant, how to design, and how to make outdoor life feel grounded and generous.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="journal-categories">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Seasonal Living</h2>
      <div class="posts">
        <article>
          <h3>What to plant in Indiana in fall</h3>
          <p>A practical planting calendar for cool-season harvests that still feel abundant.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Transitioning gardens into winter</h3>
          <p>How to close the season with intention and prepare your beds for a strong spring.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <h2>Garden Design</h2>
      <div class="posts">
        <article>
          <h3>Designing raised beds that feel beautiful</h3>
          <p>Layout principles that create order, elegance, and daily ease.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Best layouts for family gardens</h3>
          <p>Flexible bed arrangements that support cooking, gathering, and kid-friendly access.</p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <h2>Slow Living / Lifestyle</h2>
      <div class="posts">
        <article>
          <h3>Gardening rituals</h3>
          <p>Small, repeatable rhythms that keep gardening restorative instead of overwhelming.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Hosting from the garden</h3>
          <p>Simple ways to shape memorable meals and gatherings around seasonal harvest.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Cut flower arrangements</h3>
          <p>Garden-to-vase techniques for balanced, natural bouquets from your own beds.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .journal-hero {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.9), rgba(45, 80, 22, 0.55)),
      url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1466692476868-aef1dfb1e735?w=1800&h=900&fit=crop') center/cover;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .journal-hero h1,
  .journal-hero p {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .journal-hero h1 {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  .journal-categories {
    padding: var(--spacing-2xl) var(--spacing-lg);
    background: #f7f5ef;
  }

  .journal-categories h2 {
    color: #2a3b17;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
  }

  .journal-categories h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .posts {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .posts article {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #e6dfcf;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md);
  }

  .posts h3 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .posts {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>